<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sabre Group started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sabre Group started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan said it started coverage of Sabre Group Holdings Inc as buy with a 12-month price target of $35.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/8 to 29-1/2.</p>
</text>
